                          Disable a set of new -fbounds-safety run-time checks, (option: access_size, indirect_count_update, return_size, ended_by_lower_bound, compound_literal_init, libc_attributes, array_subscript_agg, all, batch_0)
  -fno-bounds-safety-relaxed-system-headers
